\section*{App Design: Tracking Location Without Consent}

\begin{itemize}
    \item Requires explicit user consent before recording location data
    \item Uses background services to collect coordinates continuously
    \item Stores data on independent servers (Firebase Firestore)
    \item Requires access to GPS hardware with user permission
    \item Must implement data retention policies matching local laws
\end{itemize}

\subsection*{Implementation Challenges}
\begin{itemize}
    \item Legal requirements vary by jurisdiction (GDPR, CCPA, etc.)
    \item User opt-in frameworks must be technically robust
    \item Logging location without permission violates trust [3.3]
